      "Text": "Security update for PackageKit",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for PackageKit fixes the following issues:\n\nSecurity issue fixed:\n\n- CVE-2026-10294: manipulation of the argument frontend-socket can lead to improper authorization (bsc#1267250).\n\nNon security issue fixed:\n\n- KDE Discover ignores package locks (bsc#1263252).\n",
